<h2>Knowledge Map — Douzone</h2>
<p>This page is a knowledge map that consolidates the <strong>DOUZONE World</strong> (work and organizational knowledge). Knowledge in this wiki is organized in four levels, <strong>World → Domain → System → Document</strong>, and this map covers the DOUZONE World among them. It shows <strong>which System each company knowledge document belongs to and how they connect to one another</strong>. Each document's summary, key concepts, and related documents come from the structural knowledge index an AI built (<code>knowledge-index.json</code>), and you can explore these relations in three 3D and six 2D views in the <a href="#!cosmos"><strong>Knowledge Graph</strong></a>. Course and learning knowledge is aggregated with the same structure by the <a href="#!ai-map"><strong>AI Knowledge Map</strong></a>.</p>

