<h3>Bridges that link knowledge — bridge concepts</h3>
<p>Concepts that appear in <strong>several Systems at once</strong> become &ldquo;bridges&rdquo; across branches. The two Systems of the DOUZONE World (the proposal series) <strong>share no key concept yet, so no bridge is aggregated</strong> — once a concept spans three or more Systems it appears here automatically. For now, concepts such as <strong>Knowledge platform · AI curator · Knowledge management</strong> connect by topic to the AI World (the Second Brain and LLM Wiki Systems), which makes them candidate bridges across Worlds.</p>

